			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-15T22:33:37Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				100,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Rest): Add comprehensive architecture documentation\n\nCreate `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` to detail the design and operation of the Rest component, the high-performance TypeScript compiler built on the OXC toolchain.\n\nThe document covers the OXC compilation pipeline (Parse, Semantic Analysis, Transform, Codegen, Bundle), parallel processing via Rayon, and integration with the Output element via the `RestPlugin`. It includes visual diagrams (Mermaid and ASCII) illustrating the module map and data flow, as well as detailed CLI usage examples and performance benchmarks comparing Rest against esbuild.\n\nThis addition provides developers with a clear reference for the compiler's internal structure and its role in the Land ecosystem's build pipeline.",
			"SHA": "a0e2742b37651e9d75bb562f6a7ee80378f1cd58"
		},
